==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*100 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Rain D.]] spawns.
**1 [[Rain D.]] spawns.
**1 [[Rain D.]] spawns.
**1 [[Rain D.]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Rain D. has a lot of knockbacks, so use easily-stackable heavy-hitting units like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to push him back, defended by a steady stream of meatshields. When the group of Rain Ds appear, use strong, fast area attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to keep them away from your base, along with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] instead. Use the [[Cat Cannon]] when their attacks de-sync so that they all attack at the same time, reducing their ability to push.

